OL,3,AAlleged spy told police he would harm
OL,4,Ahimself - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains details
OL,7,Fthat some may find disturbing.
OL,9,FA former Royal Marine found dead after
OL,10,Fhe was charged with assisting the Hong
OL,11,FKong intelligence service told police
OL,12,Fhe would harm himself after he left
OL,13,Fcustody, an inquest heard.
OL,15,FMatthew Trickett, 37, a Home Office
OL,16,Fimmigration officer, had appeared in
OL,17,Fcourt charged under the National
OL,18,FSecurity Act and was found dead in a
OL,19,Fpark in Maidenhead on 19 May 2024.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
