OL,3,AAlleged spy told police he would harm
OL,4,Ahimself - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had been arrested on 1 May 2024 and
OL,7,Fwas seen to attempt self-harm in his
OL,8,Fcell on 11 May. He was put under
OL,9,Fconstant supervision but released on
OL,10,Fbail two days later.
